    "committer": "GitHub <noreply@github.com>",
    "message": "docs: keep the vignette build off the network (#163)\n\nparseAndValidateGenomeSpec(dataMode = \"http\") sends an httr::HEAD to every\nURL it is given, and the custom-genome-http chunk had no eval=FALSE, so\nbuilding the vignette reached out to gladki.pl. When that host did not\nresolve on 2026-07-31 the ubuntu job died in \"creating vignettes\", before\nR CMD check started; the same request runs on the Bioconductor build\nmachines and in every user's R CMD build.\n\nShow the chunk instead of running it, and say in the prose why.",
    "time": 1785510545
